{"id":"eb6e41357970ae6c","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-independent-formula.md","title":"An Independent Pi-One Family","display":"thm-independent-formula — An Independent Pi-One Family","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-independent-formula","aliases":["67-thm-independent-formula"],"display":"thm-independent-formula — An Independent Pi-One Family","depends_on":["[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-independent-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":2,"source_label":"Theorem 9","source_printed_pages":31,"source_pdf_pages":42,"source_proof_status":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-independent-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-independent-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-independent-formula — An Independent Pi-One Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fde932e35a45d307\" href=\"?note=fde932e35a45d307\" title=\"67-df-independent-formula\">67-df-independent-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"31"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"42"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 是一致原始递归公理呈示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Indep}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Indep}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fde932e35a45d307\" href=\"?note=fde932e35a45d307\" title=\"67-df-independent-formula\">67-df-independent-formula</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\)</span> 为至多自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的公式集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\)</span> 在本原子精确指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\">\\(\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是数词实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(\\bar n)\">\\(\\xi(\\bar n)\\)</span> 中被代入的指定变量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\xi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\\mathrm{Indep}_T(\\xi,\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\xi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\\mathrm{Indep}_T(\\xi,\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.9, p.31。源证明用 Rosser 式比较有限命题组合的正反证明，再取第一个使某组合不一致的最小下标和最小证明，分别排除两种末位符号。它比仅存在一个不可判定句更强。本条已核对构造与陈述，尚未独立形式验证全部编码细节。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-independent-formula","status":"resolved","id":"fde932e35a45d307","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-independent-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq Q$ 是一致原始递归公理呈示；$\\Pi_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]，$\\mathrm{Indep}_T$ 见 [[67-df-independent-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-independent-formula","status":"resolved","id":"fde932e35a45d307","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq Q$ 是一致原始递归公理呈示；$\\Pi_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]，$\\mathrm{Indep}_T$ 见 [[67-df-independent-formula]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Indep}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi(\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\xi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\\mathrm{Indep}_T(\\xi,\\mathbb N).","display":true}],"bytes":1579,"backlinks":[{"id":"4acca08be2551459","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}